{"material_id": "ntce.youer.baojiao.2017b-k2.q14.material.recovered", "text": "操场上新安装了一个投篮架。幼儿经常在这里玩投篮游戏。一天，几个幼儿带着笔刷和水桶来到这里，他们先是快乐地粉刷投篮架，之后开始往篮筐里灌水，有的从上面灌，有的在下面灌，再装，再灌……，反反复复，忙得不亦乐乎。15是否应支持这些幼儿的行为？请说明理由。五、活动设计题。请根据所提供的教学材料和相关情况，按要求完成活动设计。（本题共1小题，共30分）", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "d9cc9025c78363c18db9b8cc2b7cca36ab9147f2f1b670326e4000423781e020", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1141, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1314, "next_source_question_number": 16, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 14, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "d9cc9025c78363c18db9b8cc2b7cca36ab9147f2f1b670326e4000423781e020"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2017b-k2.q14"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.m5.k01", "ntce.youer.baojiao.m6.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.design", "ntce.youer.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.102.r001", "ntce.outline.102.r006", "ntce.outline.102.r007"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2017b-k2.q14"], "word_count": 172, "level": "youer", "subject": "baojiao", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "d9cc9025c78363c18db9b8cc2b7cca36ab9147f2f1b670326e4000423781e020", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1141, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1314, "next_source_question_number": 16, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 14, "alignme